 arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n</svg>\n\n                    \n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n                <div class=\"menu__submenu menu__submenu--mobile submenu js-submenu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"navigation\">\n                    <ul class=\"submenu__list submenu__list--mobile\">\n                        \n                            <li class=\"menu__item menu__item--mobile js-submenu__item \">\n                                <div class=\"submenu__container submenu__container--mobile\">\n                                    <a class=\"submenu__link submenu__link--mobile\" href=\"/apply/frequently-asked-questions-faqs\" title=\"Go to the Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) page\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</a>\n                                    \n                                \n                            </li>\n                        \n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            \n        </li>\n    \n        <li class=\"menu__item menu__item--mobile  js-submenu__item \">\n            <div class=\"submenu__container submenu__container--mobile\">\n                <a class=\"menu__link menu__link--mobile\" href=\"/contact-us\" title=\"Go to the Whakap\u0101 mai | Contact us page\">Whakap\u0101 mai | Contact us</a>\n                \n            \n        </li>\n    \n</ul>\n\n</nav>\n</header>\n\n        <h1 class=\"print-only max-width-container\">Te K\u0101hui T\u0101tari Ture | Criminal Cases Review Commission</h1>\n<main>\n    <div class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"page-header__primary-container page-header__primary-container--purple\">\n    <div class=\"page-header__watermark\">\n      <div class=\"page-header__text-container max-width-container\">\n        \n          \n        \n        <h1 class=\"page-header__title page-header__title--english\">\n          \n            Te K\u0101hui T\u0101tari Ture | Criminal Cases Review Commission\n          \n        </h1>\n        \n          <div class=\"page-header__introduction\">\n            We take a fresh look at criminal cases when a miscarriage of justice may have occured<br />\r\n\n          </div>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n    <div class=\"page-header__image-container\">\n      <div class=\"page-header__image\" style=\"background-image:url('/assets/Banner-Images/2026-Banner-images/Homepage-1920x800.jpg')\"></div>\n      <img src='/_resources/themes/ccrc/dist/images/overlayimg.png' class=\"page-header__image-overlay\" alt=\"\"></img>\n    </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n    \n    \n\t   <div class=\"element app__model__promotedblock\" id=\"e454\">\n\t\n<section class=\"page__promoted max-width-container section__spacing\">\n    \n      \n        <h2 class=\"section__heading section__heading--te-reo\" lang=\"mi-NZ\">\n          \u0100 m\u0101tou mahi \n        </h2>\n      \n      <h2 class=\"section__heading\">\n        What we do\n      </h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"cards__list cards__list--image-placement-top cards__list--image-shape-rectangle\">\n        \n            <div class=\"card card--promo1\">\n                <a class=\"card__link button button--accent-colour link link--arrow-button-hover\" href=\"/about-us/investigate-and-review\" title=\"Go to the Investigate and review page\">\n                    <div class=\"card__container\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"banner__holder\">\n                            \n                            <img class=\"card__banner\" src=\"/assets/Banner-Images/2026-Banner-images/Unsplash/doug-bagg-kbcLPOKZnuY-unsplash__FocusFillWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsNzY3LDUxMl0.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"banner__overlay banner__overlay--card\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"banner__hover-icon\">\n                                <svg class=\"hover-icon hover-icon--plus\" role=\"img\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"/_resources/themes/signify-factory/images/svg-sprite-sheet.svg#plus\"></use>\n</svg>\n\n\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"card__copy\">\n                            <div class=\"copy__container\">\n                                <h3 class=\"card__header\">\n                                  \n                                  Investigate and review\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"card__contents\">We review and investigate criminal convictions and sentences</p>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                                <svg class=\"svg__arrow svg__arrow--dark\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n    <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"80%\" y2=\"10\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow__head--dark)\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    <marker id=\"arrow__head--dark\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"20\" refX=\"20\" refY=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n        <polyline points=\"10,2 20,10 10,18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    </marker>\n</svg>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        \n        \n            <div class=\"card card--promo2\">\n                <a class=\"card__link button button--accent-colour link link--arrow-button-hover\" href=\"/about-us/systemic-issues\" title=\"Go to the Systemic Issues page\">\n                    <div class=\"card__container\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"banner__holder\">\n                            \n                            <img class=\"card__banner\" src=\"/assets/Banner-Images/2026-Banner-images/Unsplash/Manuka/jason-gardner-izOzYJlTtYw-unsplash__FocusFillWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsNzY3LDUxMl0.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"banner__overlay banner__overlay--card\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"banner__hover-icon\">\n                                <svg class=\"hover-icon hover-icon--plus\" role=\"img\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"/_resources/themes/signify-factory/images/svg-sprite-sheet.svg#plus\"></use>\n</svg>\n\n\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"card__copy\">\n                            <div class=\"copy__container\">\n                                <h3 class=\"card__header\">\n                                  \n                                  Systemic Issues\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"card__contents\">We identify patterns and systemic issues in the justice system</p>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                                <svg class=\"svg__arrow svg__arrow--dark\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n    <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"80%\" y2=\"10\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow__head--dark)\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    <marker id=\"arrow__head--dark\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"20\" refX=\"20\" refY=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n        <polyline points=\"10,2 20,10 10,18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    </marker>\n</svg>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        \n        \n            <div class=\"card card--promo3\">\n                <a class=\"card__link button button--accent-colour link link--arrow-button-hover\" href=\"/about-us/outreach-and-education\" title=\"Go to the Outreach and education page\">\n                    <div class=\"card__container\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"banner__holder\">\n                            \n                            <img class=\"card__banner\" src=\"/assets/Banner-Images/2026-Banner-images/Unsplash/Water/toby-hall-S27BjzmuRf4-unsplash__FocusFillWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsNzY3LDUxMl0.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"banner__overlay banner__overlay--card\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"banner__hover-icon\">\n                                <svg class=\"hover-icon hover-icon--plus\" role=\"img\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"/_resources/themes/signify-factory/images/svg-sprite-sheet.svg#plus\"></use>\n</svg>\n\n\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"card__copy\">\n                            <div class=\"copy__container\">\n                                <h3 class=\"card__header\">\n                                  \n                                  Outreach and education\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"card__contents\">We raise awareness of our role and how people can apply</p>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                                <svg class=\"svg__arrow svg__arrow--dark\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n    <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"80%\" y2=\"10\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow__head--dark)\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    <marker id=\"arrow__head--dark\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"20\" refX=\"20\" refY=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n        <polyline points=\"10,2 20,10 10,18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"arrow__stroke arrow__stroke--dark\" />\n    </marker>\n</svg>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\t   <div class=\"element dnadesign__elemental__models__elementcontent\" id=\"e455\">\n\t<div class=\"page__content content-element__content typography max-width-container section__spacing\">\n    \n    <div style=\"float: center; margin: 20px auto; padding: 30px 50px 45px; border: 1px solid #ededed; border-radius: 50px; background-image: url(&#039;/assets/Uploads/Tohu-Watermark-1.png&#039;); background-position: center right; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-color: #d9f3ee;\">\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><span style=\"color: #034a60; font-weight: 500;\">If you believe you have been wrongly convicted or sentenced, apply for a review&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h3>\n<h2 class=\"text-center\"><span style=\"color: #034a60; font-weight: 500;\">Tono Mai</span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/assets/Application-Form/FINAL_ccrc_application_english_20201005.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"button-link\">Apply now</span></a></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n\n</main>\n\n        <a id=\"js-back-to-top\" class=\"button button--back-to-top no-print\" title=\"Go to top\">\n  <div class=\"button__container button__container--back-to-top\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 19 10\">\n      <defs>\n        <style>\n          .arrow--top {\n            fill: none;\n            stroke-linecap: round;\n            stroke-linejoin: round;\n            stroke-width: 1px;\n            fill-rule: evenodd;\n          }\n        </style>\n      </defs>\n      <path id=\"Arrow\" class=\"arrow--top\" d=\"M0.2,9.169L9.351,0.014l9.155,8.451\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</a>\n\n        <div class=\"site__footer js-site__footer\">\n    <div class=\"contact-details\">\n        <div class=\"contact-details__container max-width-container\">\n            \n                <div class=\"contact-details__block block\">\n                    <p class=\"contact-details__header\">Contact us</p>\n                    \n                        <address class=\"contact-details__email contact-details__item\"><i class=\"far fa-envelope\"></i></i> <a class=\"email__link--footer\" href=\"mailto:info@ccrc.nz\">info@ccrc.nz</a></address>\n                    \n                    \n                        <address class=\"contact-details__phone contact-details__item\">\n                        \n                        <i class=\"fas fa-phone\"></i>\n                        \n                        <a href=\"tel:0800 33 77 88\">\n                            0800 33 77 88\n                            \n                        </a>\n                        </address>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <address class=\"contact-details__post contact-details__item\"><i class=\"fas fa-mail-bulk\"></i> PO Box 9168, Hamilton 3240</address>\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n            \n            <div class=\"contact-details__links\">\n                <nav class=\"content-info__links content-info__links--footer\">\n                    \n                        <a href=\"/contact-us\" title=\"Whakap\u0101 mai | Contact us\">Whakap\u0101 mai | Contact us &raquo;</a>\n                        \n                    \n                        <a href=\"/privacy\" title=\"W\u0101hi Matatapu | Privacy\">W\u0101hi Matatapu | Privacy &raquo;</a>\n                        \n                    \n                </nav>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n                <div class=\"contact-details__brand contact-details__block block\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"contact-details__logo brand__item\">\n                            <a class=\"contact-details__logo-link\" href=\"https://www.govt.nz\"><img src=\"/assets/Logos/PNG-NZGovt-logo-expanded-wordmark__ScaleHeightWzEwMF0.png\"